<body>
    <h1>Product Hierarchy Updates (To Provide New Sku&#39;s to Salesforce)<=
/h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>
<style>[data-colorid=3Dc0bd53b23e]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Dc0bd53b23e]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Duzu9mfgcli]{c=
olor:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Duzu9mfgcli]{colo=
r:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Diixznlo0mq]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=
=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Diixznlo0mq]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Da4ha7k8n=
s6]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Da4ha7k8ns6]=
{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Duuqasrft5v]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-m=
ode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Duuqasrft5v]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Du4cv3=
f28xl]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Du4cv3f28=
xl]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Douun8expyu]{color:#bf2600} html[data-colo=
r-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Douun8expyu]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Dsj=
aak51eff]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dsjaak=
51eff]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Dyhbllevyyz]{color:#bf2600} html[data-c=
olor-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dyhbllevyyz]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=
=3Du729zqasjy]{color:#bf2600} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3D=
u729zqasjy]{color:#ff6640}[data-colorid=3Dytntnjvbti]{color:#bf2600} html[d=
ata-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dytntnjvbti]{color:#ff6640}</style><s=
trong><span data-colorid=3D"yhbllevyyz">DUE to Coastal by June 26th. </span=
></strong></p>
<p>Updating our Product Hierarchy to prepare for Coastal/Salesforce. The ab=
ilities of Salesforce allow us to move away from 18,000+ sku's to more of a=
 pick the solution and then pick the attributes, users, server type etc.&nb=
sp;Our D365 hierarchy currently has 6 layers, these layers are named differ=
ently in different areas so I have summarized below.</p>
<p>For the new Salesforce org we are proposing to move our Sku=E2=80=99s up=
 to Level 4 or 3 then utilizing attributes and the configurator to calculat=
e price and provided necessary details for key generation and provisioning.=
</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"f6=
008ec4-37b6-49c5-adaa-02c1bfc87b18" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 316.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1483.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<h2 id=3D"ProductHierarchyUpdates(ToProvideNewSku'stoSalesforce)-ProductHie=
rarchyLevels"><strong>Product Hierarchy Levels</strong></h2></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<h2 id=3D"ProductHierarchyUpdates(ToProvideNewSku'stoSalesforce)-OtherNamin=
gConventionsAKA">Other Naming Conventions AKA</h2></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Unit 0.00</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Segment, Family Unit</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Solution Group 1.00</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sub-Segment</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Solution Category 2.00</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Business Unit, Brand Level (Used on Fortra Support Portal KB/Downloads)<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"a4ha7k8ns6">Solution 3.00</span></strong><=
/p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"ytntnjvbti">Product Family (Used on Fortra=
 Support Portal KB/Downloads)</span></strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"u729zqasjy">Feature 4.00</span></strong></=
p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"c0bd53b23e">Software Product Family (Used =
on Fortra Support Portal for Case Selection)</span></strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"uuqasrft5v">Product/SKU 5.0</span></strong=
></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"u4cv3f28xl">This is the actual SKU's on qu=
otes/system Products etc.&nbsp;</span></strong></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Note: Level's (Unit) 0.00 and 2.00 (Solution Category) are set and done,=
 no changes or review needed. &nbsp; &nbsp;**&nbsp;(Please note leadership =
are still confirming =E2=80=9CTerranova =3D Human Risk Management=E2=80=9D,=
 and splitting up =E2=80=9CDREP =3D Data Protection, Email Protection=E2=80=
=9D).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"ProductHierarchyUpdates(ToProvideNewSku'stoSalesforce)-ACTIONITEM=
sNeededbyJune26thendofday"><strong><span data-colorid=3D"iixznlo0mq"><u>ACT=
ION ITEMs Needed by June 26th end of day</u></span></strong></h2>
<p>I have made 16 copies of my original document. Each document has all sku=
s that were pulled from D365.. I then filtered each to just what sku's are =
related to each "Solution Category" I left the other sku's from all others =
in case you need to adjust and add something that was wrongly marked.&nbsp;=
</p>
<p>Edit: Excel Tab =E2=80=9CALL Products=E2=80=9D</p>
<p>Review on: Excel Tab =E2=80=9COption Sets=E2=80=9D</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"sjaak51eff">Review all items under "Soluti=
on 3.00" </span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Filter by column H "Number" 3.00</p></li>
<li>
<p>Remove: Update Column K add "Remove" where we can consolidate</p></li>
<li>
<p>Rename: Update column M =E2=80=9CNew Name=E2=80=9D to update the name of=
 any item</p></li>
<li>
<p>Add: add new row where necessary</p></li>
<li>
<p>Associate: Use Dropdown to update the Hierarchy fields 1.00 &amp; 2.00 w=
here necessary</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"uzu9mfgcli">Review all items under "Featur=
e 4.00" </span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Filter by column H "Number" 4.00</p></li>
<li>
<p>Remove: Update Column K add "Remove" where we can consolidate&nbsp;&nbsp=
;</p></li>
<li>
<p>Rename: Or update column M =E2=80=9CNew Name=E2=80=9D to update the name=
 of an item</p></li>
<li>
<p>Add: add new row where necessary</p></li>
<li>
<p>Associate: Use Dropdown to update the Hierarchy fields 1.00 &amp; 2.00 &=
amp; 3.00 where necessary</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong><span data-colorid=3D"ouun8expyu">Review all items under "Produc=
t/Sku 4.00" </span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Filter by column H "Number" 5.00</p></li>
<li>
<p>Remove: Update Column K to "Remove" where we can consolidate&nbsp;&nbsp;=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Associate: Use Dropdown to update the Hierarchy fields 1.00 &amp; 2.00 &=
amp; 3.00 &amp; 4.00 where necessary</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
